    "Shows how long the weekly limit may last, or the longest other limit when there is no weekly one. A shorter limit that states its length, including five hours, appears when that pace runs out before its reset. Predicted reset is the public Codex Resets forecast on ChatGPT cards, not that account's own clock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows how long the weekly limit may last, or the longest other limit when there is no weekly one. A shorter limit that states its length, including five hours, appears when that pace runs out before its reset. Predicted reset is the public Codex Resets forecast on ChatGPT cards, not that account's own clock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示每周限额按当前速度还要多久用尽；没有每周限额时，显示其余限额里最长的那条。长度已经写明的较短限额，包括 5 小时，会在它自己的速度撑不到重置时出现。预测重置是 ChatGPT 卡片上的 Codex Resets 公开预测，不是这个账号自己的重置时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
